## Repository Layout — Multi-Repo Wrapper

This root directory is a thin wrapper acting as the shared specs/documentation
repository. The subdirectories are **independent git repositories** with their own
remotes — always run git commands inside the subdirectory you changed, never at
the root:

- `{{BACKEND_DIR}}/` — {{BACKEND_STACK_SUMMARY}} (`{{BACKEND_REPO_URL}}`)
